    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is a constant of integration, then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to:"
